```


:::
:::


There are 22 unique orders.

[Count how many times the CA concentration is greater than the MG concentration.]{.blue-text}


::: {.cell}

```{.r .cell-code}
mg_ca <- inverts |>
  filter(CA > MG) |>
  nrow()
print (mg_ca)
```

::: {.cell-output .cell-output-stdout}

```
